    <string name="rule_info_message" tools:ignore="MissingTranslation">All configured groups must match (AND). At home and outside home are mutually exclusive options. If weekdays are selected, any selected day can match (OR); no selection means every day. Within calendar keywords, any word can match (OR). Bluetooth and Android Auto are also alternatives (OR). Calendar rules are active from 3 hours before until the event ends. Cooldown starts when the complete rule stops matching.</string>
